lt;div class=&#34;race-bar-swim&#34; style=&#34;width:10.5%&#34;&gt;10.5%&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;race-bar-bike&#34; style=&#34;width:50.2%&#34;&gt;50.2%&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;race-bar-run&#34; style=&#34;width:39.3%&#34;&gt;39.3%&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;race-bar-row&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;race-bar-label&#34;&gt;Miami 70.3 2017&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;race-bar-track&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;race-bar-swim&#34; style=&#34;width:15.9%&#34;&gt;15.9%&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;race-bar-bike&#34; style=&#34;width:48.7%&#34;&gt;48.7%&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;race-bar-run&#34; style=&#34;width:35.4%&#34;&gt;35.4%&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;race-bar-row&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;race-bar-label&#34;&gt;Mont Tremblant 140.6 2017&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;race-bar-track&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;race-bar-swim&#34; style=&#34;width:9.7%&#34;&gt;9.7%&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;race-bar-bike&#34; style=&#34;width:50.9%&#34;&gt;50.9%&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;race-bar-run&#34; style=&#34;width:39.4%&#34;&gt;39.4%&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;race-bar-row&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;race-bar-label&#34;&gt;Eagleman 70.3 2018&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;race-bar-track&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;race-bar-swim&#34; style=&#34;width:9.5%&#34;&gt;9.5%&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;race-bar-bike&#34; style=&#34;width:50.9%&#34;&gt;50.9%&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;race-bar-run&#34; style=&#34;width:39.6%&#34;&gt;39.6%&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
      
